locked 1/3 of the way up, then L = 64", since the top portion is the ~~
longest unbloked part.Definition: 96Nodelocation: 72,160,1Nodesize: 48,24Aliases: Formnode LengthDecision DTitle: DepthUnits: inDescription: Standard lumber size depth.   For example, for a 2x4 comp~~
