   Error("The post thickness is beyond available table values")~
else if D>Max_depth_supported then~
  Error("The post depth is beyond available table values")~
else ~
  Fc0 * CfNodelocation: 208,424,1Nodesize: 48,24Valuestate: 2,493,271,416,303,0,MIDMDecision Timber_typeTitle: Timber typeDefinition: Choice(Self,1)Nodelocation: 72,48,1Nodesize: 48,24Aliases: Formnode Timber_type1Domain: ['sawn lumber','glue laminated lumber']{!40000|Att_previndexvalue: ['sawn lumber','glue laminated lumber']}Variable CpTitle: Column stability factorDefinition: var A:=0.5/c * (1+Fce / Fc);~
Var B:=1/c * (Fce/Fc);~
A - sqrt(A*A - B)Nodelocation: 336,424,1Nodesize: 48,31Variable CTitle: cDefinition: Determtable(Timber_type)(~
